X.SH SYNOPSIS
Xwanderer [ -e [file] | -m | -c | -s | -f ]
X.SH DESCRIPTION
XThe object of the game is to move around, collecting treasure, and escape
Xthrough the exit.
XThe idea for the game came from the games 'Repton', 'Boulderdash'
Xand 'XOR', and was then developed further.
